Freed Rāvaṇa challenges Vālin at Kiṣkindhā --- Minister Tāra warns of bone piles and ocean rite --- Rāvaṇa flies south and creeps on praying Vālin --- Vālin tucks Rāvaṇa armpit and soars skyward --- Pursuing ministers fall exhausted behind --- Vālin honors twilight across four oceans --- Vālin drops Rāvaṇa laughing at Kiṣkindhā grove --- Rāvaṇa praises Vālin and seeks fire brotherhood --- Pair bonds before fire sharing all and sojourns month --- Agastya calls Vālin matchless yet moth burnt